## Legacy path

Do **not** use `mg-testing-*` or a plain `VAP-xxxx` task branch.

| Step | Delegation |
|------|------------|
| **L1** | [`y-git-branch-name.mdc`](y-git-branch-name.mdc) — `<type>/VAP-xxxx-desc`. Base branch is **not** forced to `production`. |
| **L2** | Implement + local tests; [`y-git-commits.mdc`](y-git-commits.mdc) when asked; [`y-git-track-new-files.mdc`](y-git-track-new-files.mdc) as needed. |
| **L3+** | Full [`y-git-create-pr.mdc`](y-git-create-pr.mdc) **Task PR** (Calendar, Slack, In Review checklist). PR-rejected rework stays inside that rule (fix on the task branch, push, same PR). |

After the Task PR is **merged** into `testing`, continue at **N8** (shared tail). After QA, **N10** and **N11** apply the same as the new path.

